>> write {"content":"# Response templates for procedural how-to discovery (issue #918).\n#\n# The discovery plan, the install source gate, the source paths and the stage\n# lines of the live wikiHow, official-documentation and fallback searches. Moved\n# out of data/seed/multilingual-responses-synthesis.lino by category so each\n# response file stays within 1500 lines. Placeholders in braces are filled by the\n# handler.\n\nmultilingual_responses\n  response response_procedural_how_to_plan_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_plan\n    language en\n    text \"Procedural discovery plan for `{task}` (action `{action}`, object `{object}`).\\n\\n{install_gate}I do not answer this from a memoized recipe. The solver first checks Wikipedia for topic context and Wikidata for entity/action/object hints. It then tries wikiHow's CORS-readable MediaWiki parse API candidate `{candidate}` via `{api_url}`. If those sources do not expose usable steps, the fallback path runs web search for `{search_query}` across {providers} and merges the top results with reciprocal rank fusion (k = {k}). The final recursive fetch check only accepts pages that actually contain explicit ordered or instructional steps for `{task}`.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_install_gate_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_install_gate\n    language en\n    text \"For install tasks, the first source gate prefers the product's official documentation or official repository install page before community how-to sources. It starts with the official-source web search query `{search_query}` and keeps the general how-to query `{fallback_query}` as fallback.\\n\\n\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_plan_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_plan\n    language ru\n    text \"План поиска процедуры для `{task}` (действие `{action}`, объект `{object}`).\\n\\n{install_gate}Я не отвечаю на это как на заученный рецепт. Сначала solver проверяет Wikipedia для контекста темы и Wikidata для подсказок сущности, действия и объекта. Затем он пробует CORS-readable MediaWiki parse API wikiHow для кандидата `{candidate}` через `{api_url}`. Если эти источники не дают пригодные шаги, fallback запускает web search по `{search_query}` через {providers} и объединяет верхние результаты reciprocal rank fusion (k = {k}). Финальная recursive fetch check принимает только страницы с явными упорядоченными или инструкционными шагами для `{task}`.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_install_gate_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_install_gate\n    language ru\n    text \"Для задач установки первый source gate ищет официальную документацию продукта или официальную страницу установки в репозитории, а уже потом переходит к общим how-to источникам. Он начинает с web search запроса `{search_query}` и держит общий how-to запрос `{fallback_query}` как fallback. \"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_plan_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_plan\n    language hi\n    text \"`{task}` के लिए procedural discovery plan (action `{action}`, object `{object}`).\\n\\n{install_gate}मैं इसे memorized recipe से answer नहीं करता. Solver पहले topic context के लिए Wikipedia और entity/action/object hints के लिए Wikidata जांचता है. फिर वह candidate `{candidate}` के लिए wikiHow का CORS-readable MediaWiki parse API `{api_url}` से आजमाता है. अगर ये sources usable steps नहीं देते, fallback `{search_query}` के लिए {providers} पर web search चलाता है और top results को reciprocal rank fusion (k = {k}) से merge करता है. अंतिम recursive fetch check केवल उन pages को स्वीकार करता है जिनमें `{task}` के explicit ordered या instructional steps हों.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_install_gate_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_install_gate\n    language hi\n    text \"इंस्टॉल वाले कामों में पहला source gate उत्पाद की आधिकारिक documentation या official repository install page को प्राथमिकता देता है; उसके बाद ही community how-to sources देखे जाते हैं. Solver official-source web search query `{search_query}` पहले चलाता है और general how-to query `{fallback_query}` को fallback रखता है. \"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_plan_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_plan\n    language zh\n    text \"`{task}` 的过程发现计划（action `{action}`, object `{object}`）。\\n\\n{install_gate}我不会把它当作记忆中的固定 recipe 来回答。Solver 先检查 Wikipedia 获取主题上下文，再检查 Wikidata 获取 entity/action/object 线索。然后它尝试 wikiHow 的 CORS-readable MediaWiki parse API candidate `{candidate}`，URL 为 `{api_url}`。如果这些来源没有可用步骤，fallback 会对 `{search_query}` 通过 {providers} 运行 web search，并用 reciprocal rank fusion (k = {k}) 合并顶部结果。最后的 recursive fetch check 只接受真正包含 `{task}` 的明确有序步骤或 instructional steps 的页面。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_plan_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_plan\n    language es\n    text \"Plan de descubrimiento del procedimiento para `{task}` (acción `{action}`, objeto `{object}`).\\n\\n{install_gate}No respondo a esto con una receta memorizada. El solucionador consulta primero Wikipedia para el contexto del tema y Wikidata para pistas sobre la entidad, la acción y el objeto. Después prueba la API de análisis MediaWiki de wikiHow, legible por CORS, con el candidato `{candidate}` mediante `{api_url}`. Si esas fuentes no ofrecen pasos utilizables, la ruta alternativa ejecuta una búsqueda web de `{search_query}` en {providers} y combina los mejores resultados con reciprocal rank fusion (k = {k}). La comprobación final de obtención recursiva solo acepta páginas que contengan realmente pasos explícitos, ordenados o instructivos, para `{task}`.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_install_gate_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_install_gate\n    language zh\n    text \"对于安装类任务，第一个 source gate 优先查找产品官方 documentation 或官方仓库的安装页面，然后才使用社区 how-to 来源。Solver 先运行官方来源 web search query `{search_query}`，并把通用 how-to query `{fallback_query}` 保留为 fallback。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_install_gate_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_install_gate\n    language es\n    text \"Para las tareas de instalación, el primer filtro de fuentes prefiere la documentación oficial del producto o la página de instalación del repositorio oficial antes que las guías de la comunidad. Empieza con la consulta de búsqueda web de fuentes oficiales `{search_query}` y mantiene la consulta general de guía `{fallback_query}` como alternativa.\\n\\n\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow\n    language en\n    text \"Source path: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> wikiHow API fallback -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow\n    language ru\n    text \"Путь источников: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> wikiHow API fallback -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow\n    language hi\n    text \"स्रोत पथ: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> wikiHow API fallback -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check।\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow\n    language zh\n    text \"来源路径：Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> 官方文档 web search -> wikiHow API fallback -> 社区 web search fallback -> recursive fetch check。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_wikihow\n    language es\n    text \"Ruta de fuentes: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> búsqueda web en la documentación oficial -> API de wikiHow como alternativa -> búsqueda web alternativa en la comunidad -> comprobación de obtención recursiva.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow\n    language en\n    text \"Source path: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (wikiHow disabled in settings).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow\n    language ru\n    text \"Путь источников: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (wikiHow отключен в настройках).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow\n    language hi\n    text \"स्रोत पथ: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> official documentation web search -> community web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (settings में wikiHow बंद है)।\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow\n    language zh\n    text \"来源路径：Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> 官方文档 web search -> 社区 web search fallback -> recursive fetch check（设置中已禁用 wikiHow）。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_install_no_wikihow\n    language es\n    text \"Ruta de fuentes: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> búsqueda web en la documentación oficial -> búsqueda web alternativa en la comunidad -> comprobación de obtención recursiva (wikiHow desactivado en los ajustes).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow\n    language en\n    text \"Source path: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> wikiHow API -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow\n    language ru\n    text \"Путь источников: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> wikiHow API -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow\n    language hi\n    text \"स्रोत पथ: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> wikiHow API -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check।\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow\n    language zh\n    text \"来源路径：Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> wikiHow API -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_wikihow\n    language es\n    text \"Ruta de fuentes: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> API de wikiHow -> búsqueda web alternativa -> comprobación de obtención recursiva.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow\n    language en\n    text \"Source path: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (wikiHow disabled in settings).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow\n    language ru\n    text \"Путь источников: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (wikiHow отключен в настройках).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow\n    language hi\n    text \"स्रोत पथ: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check (settings में wikiHow बंद है)।\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow\n    language zh\n    text \"来源路径：Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> web search fallback -> recursive fetch check（设置中已禁用 wikiHow）。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_source_path_no_wikihow\n    language es\n    text \"Ruta de fuentes: Wikipedia -> Wikidata -> búsqueda web alternativa -> comprobación de obtención recursiva (wikiHow desactivado en los ajustes).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_heading_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_heading\n    language en\n    text \"Procedural discovery plan for `{task}` (action `{action}`, object `{object}`).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_live_install_gate_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_live_install_gate\n    language en\n    text \"For install tasks, the first source gate prefers the product's official documentation or official repository install page before community how-to sources. It starts with `{search_query}` and keeps `{fallback_query}` as fallback.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_heading_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_heading\n    language ru\n    text \"План поиска процедуры для `{task}` (действие `{action}`, объект `{object}`).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_live_install_gate_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_live_install_gate\n    language ru\n    text \"Для задач установки первый source gate ищет официальную документацию продукта или официальную страницу установки в репозитории, а уже потом переходит к общим how-to источникам. Он начинает с `{search_query}` и держит `{fallback_query}` как fallback.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_heading_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_heading\n    language hi\n    text \"`{task}` के लिए procedural discovery plan (action `{action}`, object `{object}`).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_live_install_gate_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_live_install_gate\n    language hi\n    text \"इंस्टॉल वाले कामों में पहला source gate उत्पाद की आधिकारिक documentation या official repository install page को प्राथमिकता देता है; उसके बाद ही community how-to sources देखे जाते हैं. Solver पहले `{search_query}` चलाता है और `{fallback_query}` को fallback रखता है.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_heading_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_heading\n    language zh\n    text \"`{task}` 的过程发现计划（action `{action}`, object `{object}`）。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_heading_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_heading\n    language es\n    text \"Plan de descubrimiento del procedimiento para `{task}` (acción `{action}`, objeto `{object}`).\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_live_install_gate_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_live_install_gate\n    language zh\n    text \"对于安装类任务，第一个 source gate 优先查找产品官方 documentation 或官方仓库的安装页面，然后才使用社区 how-to 来源。Solver 先运行 `{search_query}`，并把 `{fallback_query}` 保留为 fallback。\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_live_install_gate_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_live_install_gate\n    language es\n    text \"Para las tareas de instalación, el primer filtro de fuentes prefiere la documentación oficial del producto o la página de instalación del repositorio oficial antes que las guías de la comunidad. Empieza con `{search_query}` y mantiene `{fallback_query}` como alternativa.\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search\n    language en\n    text \"Official-documentation web search for `{query}`:\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_ru\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search\n    language ru\n    text \"Веб-поиск по официальной документации для `{query}`:\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_hi\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search\n    language hi\n    text \"`{query}` के लिए official documentation web search:\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_zh\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search\n    language zh\n    text \"`{query}` 的官方文档 web search：\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_es\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search\n    language es\n    text \"Búsqueda web en la documentación oficial de `{query}`:\"\n  response response_procedural_how_to_official_search_miss_en\n    intent procedural_how_to_official_search_miss\n    language en\n    text \"Official-documentation web search for `{query}` did not ret